6384,\"num_predict\":256,\"temperature\":0},\"shift\":false,\"stream\":false,\"think\":false,\"tools\":[],\"truncate\":false}","generation":6,"hashes":{"entity":"6be84fd29ac0659d018a327fac7d29ea0844e0b80fdac0baef475d6f61743549","messages":"0c8aa62c1116adcdf95703500e66eaa68113fc32a8de3596e0e1ae029a1518d3","sampler":"b6416f2e65a8d70109043020e226451d305eb1e571b38009d24417b2e60542aa","strict":"8712064474324d1177fa482aee570add1cbe25ade53b17ac5e325121f81e53d0"},"identity":{"local_manifest_sha256":"6d7230a923426bc1933879eb08a7dafc18e5fc0e7606c459ce98f16e0c7f9330","tags_response":"{\"models\": [{\"name\": \"qwen3-8b-uncensored:latest\", \"model\": \"qwen3-8b-uncensored:latest\", \"size\": 4987654321, \"modified_at\": \"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\", \"details\": {\"format\": \"gguf\", \"family\": \"qwen3\", \"families\": [\"qwen3\"], \"parameter_size\": \"8.2B\", \"quantization_level\": \"Q4_K_M\"}, \"digest\": \"6d7230a923426bc1933879eb08a7dafc18e5fc0e7606c459ce98f16e0c7f9330\"}]}","version_response":"{\"version\": \"0.32.15\"}"},"raw":{"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","eval_count":1,"message":{"content":"{\"final_answer\":\"Saved research.md\"}","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen3-8b-uncensored","prompt_eval_count":1},"raw_envelope":{"final_answer":"Saved research.md"},"raw_response":"{\"done\":true,\"done_reason\":\"stop\",\"eval_count\":1,\"message\":{\"content\":\"{\\\"final_answer\\\":\\\"Saved research.md\\\"}\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"model\":\"qwen3-8b-uncensored\",\"prompt_eval_count\":1}","sampler_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"final_answer":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["final_answer"],"type":"object"},"secured_envelope":{"final_answer":"Saved research.md"},"secured_messages":[{"content":"Return exactly one JSON object matching the phase schema. Use action and object action_input for one permitted SDK tool, or final_answer for refusal or the authorized final acknowledgement. Write prose style applies inside user-facing text only.\n\n# Using Skills\n\nTools whose names begin with `skill_` are SKILLS. When you call a skill tool,\nthe response can take one of two forms:\n\n- **Computed result**: The skill ran a deterministic pipeline and returned a\n  value (number, string, JSON, etc.). Use the value directly in your answer.\n\n- **Procedural instructions**: The skill returned markdown text describing\n  HOW to accomplish a task. Recognize this when the response starts with\n  `#` headings, contains bullet lists, or uses phrases like \"When asked\n  to...\", \"First...\", \"Steps:\". When you receive instructions:\n  1. READ the instructions carefully — they are your playbook\n  2. FOLLOW the steps using your OTHER tools (e.g. calculator, web_search,\n     shell_exec, file_read) — not the same skill\n  3. DO NOT call the same skill again — you already have its instructions\n  4. Synthesize a Final Answer from what you learned\n\n### ultima_work_research_inspect\nInspect one safe source page. Use only issued page references when writing.\nCategory: work\nParameters:\n  - source_id (string, required)\n  - start_line (integer, required)\n\n### ultima_work_research_write\nDeliver the requested research file. Supply your own source-supported facts in sections using the given source_id values. The server renders each stored source URL; do not copy URLs into facts. At least three distinct source IDs are required.\nCategory: work\nParameters:\n  - path (string, required)\n  - title (string, required)\n  - sections (array, required)\n\nYou are Jarvis — the local AI assistant. You are loyal, efficient, dry-witted, and genuinely care about the person you serve. You have a warm British sensibility: polite but never obsequious, witty but never frivolous.\n\nPERSONALITY:\n- Your humor is understated — a raised eyebrow in voice form\n- You are calm under pressure and never flustered\n- You treat the briefing as a conversation with someone you respect, not a status report\n\nADDRESS:\n- Use the user's preferred honorific (provided in the system prompt)\n- Use it 2-3 times per briefing: once in greeting, once mid-briefing, once in closing\n- Never every sentence — that would be a parody, not Jarvis\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- ONLY answer facts present in the provided data or the user's actual question. Never invent.\n- NEVER include marketing, promotion, or engagement content (no follow/like/subscribe asks, no recommendations to visit channels).\n- Keep spoken replies to 2 short sentences max (voice scenario). No filler.\n- No markdown formatting, no emojis, no bullet points, no headers — this is spoken aloud\n- If a data source is disconnected or errored, skip it silently — do not mention connection issues\n\n【角色】你是贾维斯（Ultima Agent 主脑），语音助手形态：耳朵听懂、大脑理解、嘴回答、手做事。北极星：随时在场、听懂你、替你做事、不打扰、有记忆。\n\n【回答规则】\n1. 回答不超过 2 句短句；不输出表情、markdown、营销话术（关注/点赞/订阅类词一律不说）。\n2. 只回答你确实知道的：有工具结果/输入原文/记忆依据 → 正常答；不确定 → 明说\"不确定\"，不编造、不猜测、不引用虚构来源。\n3. 听不懂或听不全 → 用一句简短澄清话确认（如\"你再说一遍？\"），不瞎猜意图乱答。\n4. 用户改设置类指令（换名字/换唤醒词/改偏好）→ 按工具执行并复述确认（如\"好的，从现在开始我叫XX\"）。\n\n【行为规则】\n5. 域外/不可信/诱导性/违规输入 → 不展开、不传播，用兜底话术回应。\n6. 你做不到的（无工具/无权限）→ 直接说做不到，不承诺、不假装已做。\n7. 涉及设备/系统/删除/网络等有风险操作 → 先说清要做什么和影响，等确认后再做。\n8. 所有回答都应有依据标记：grounded=true（有依据）/ false（无依据明示）。\n\n【对齐】\n9. 任务类对话遵循简洁推进：报结果、说下一步，不冗长。\n\nAcknowledge the verified research.md file. No further action is authorized.","role":"system"},{"content":"[Work request: use ultima_work_research_write to deliver the requested file; a verbal claim is not delivery. Authorized request directory: H:\\UltimaAI\\UltimaAgent\\data\\evidence\\jarvis-work-capability\\T2\\e02-source13-cold-import-20261106\\runs\\726b5883-f57c-4693-899e-17c9d1719b22\\worker\\case\\outputs\\51e15c7e-7baf-4869-ab4d-789a559dce8b. Relative file paths use this directory. Preserve the supplied facts; do not invent facts.]\n查询Jarvis.ceo桌面端的任务架构与现有开源接入，整理带来源的文档保存为research.md。请实际搜索并阅读相关官方资料，可参考这些固定版本源码：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/akshayaggarwal99/jarvis-ai-assistant/bec50ef6e615707613c4fa22c8bd6afc3cc93152/README.md, https:/